    <Entry>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <JapaneseText>デュナミス孤児院</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Dunmais Orphanage</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <JapaneseText>なにしてんだ、&lt;Kyle&gt;？
ルーティさんに、話するんだろ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What are you doing, &lt;Kyle&gt;?
You're going to tell Mrs. Rutee, right?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ここは夜の孤児院前です</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>In front of the orphanage at night.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ルーティさん
まだ起きてるみたいだな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It looks like
Mrs. Rutee's still awake doesn't it.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <JapaneseText>････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>To Do</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <JapaneseText>どうする、&lt;Kyle&gt;？
旅に出る話、言いづらかったら
俺が代わりに････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Now what, &lt;Kyle&gt;?
If it's too hard to ask her about going on a journey
then I always could....</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ダメだよ、&lt;Loni&gt;
オレ、自分で言うよ
そうじゃないと････いけないと思うんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No you can't, &lt;Loni&gt;
I think this is something....
I have to do for myself.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <JapaneseText>････そうだな、すまねえ
よし！　それじゃいくか！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>....Yeah, I guess you're right.
Alrighty then!  Shall we!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <JapaneseText>今日ね、また、&lt;Kyle&gt;のこと
ぶっちゃったんだけど････
なんだか様子がちがったのよ、今回は</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I hit &lt;Kyle&gt; again,
I know I messed up but....
this time it's a different situation.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <JapaneseText>なんせ、あの子ったら
あたしに歯向かおうとしたのよ
このあたしに！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Can you believe that boy?
He was talking back to me.
His own mother!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <JapaneseText>あんたみたいな
英雄になりたいってさ、あの子
････やっぱり、あんたの子ね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Just like you
He wants to be a hero.
....He is your child, after all.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <JapaneseText>あ～あ、せめて、もう少し
あたしに似てくれたらなぁ
そんなバカなこと、言わないのに････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, I wish that he could
be a little more like me.
No, I shouldn't be saying something like that....</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <JapaneseText>････あ、笑ったでしょ、いま？
ふふっ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>....Ah, Are you laughing at me right now?
Huh!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <JapaneseText>心配しないで
覚悟はできてる････つもり</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Don't worry about me.
I'm ready to.... to....</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <JapaneseText>明日、あの子が打ち明けてきたら
そのときは、あたし････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Tomorrow, when he goes to
tell me, I'll....</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <JapaneseText>孤児院に帰らなきゃ････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I have to go back to the orphanage....</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <JapaneseText>母さんに話をしなきゃ････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I need to talk to Mom....</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <JapaneseText>母さんに話をしなきゃ････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I need to talk to Mom....</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
